  unitName: Explosive Artisan Carlos
  unitId: 850958
  unitNumber: 8642
  description: Although Carlos had decided to fight against the gang of bandits to
    protect his home, he ended up being taken hostage by them instead. The bandits
    demanded that the girl exchange her relic gun for Carlos's life, but unbeknownst
    to them the young boy had already lit the fuse tied to the explosives he was
    carrying, ready to die to protect his homeland. The girl prevented an explosion
    by shooting off the fuse with her gun, but the commotion created by it all left
    the bandits at a disadvantage. Once the battle ended, Carlos taught his tribe
    the true meaning of justice, and instilled in them a sense of duty when it comes
    to protecting their sanctuary.
  summonDesc: So this is real justice...<br>Guess the sanctuary can't teach us everything.<br>We
    should go out and learn more.
  fusionDesc: Look, my new prototype!<br>I wonder where the testing site is...<br>Hey,
    be careful with that!
  evoDesc: I can finally protect the mines and my people with this!<br>Thanks...I'm
    only saying it once, so I hope you heard me the first time.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
